rule('NSAID_INTERACTION_REVIEW',OR(cond('nsaid_or_high_dose_aspirin','==',True),cond('long_half_life_nsaid','==',True)),'consultant_review','Check medicine, dose, renal function and timing. At CrCl 45–79, avoid NSAIDs and high-dose aspirin for 2 days before, treatment day and 2 days after pemetrexed; long-half-life NSAIDs require at least 5 days before, treatment day and at least 2 days after. If necessary coadministration cannot be avoided, monitor closely for marrow and GI toxicity. High NSAID/aspirin doses also warrant caution with normal renal function. Do not stop prescribed medicines without a clinician plan.',7,SMPC,section='4.5; conditional advice, not autonomous stop-date or renal-band calculation')
